rooms_desc ({"You enter a great hall decorated with trophies that Hemis hascollected through time and space.  Through the years Hemis has accumulated quite a collection.  It ranges from the dragonjawbone that frames the door, to a single obsidian spire that marks the north exit.","As you enter the throne room you see first and foremost agreat dragon sceleton filling the room.  This dragon is far larger than anyyou have seen here in Holy Mission. Itmust be from some far off land, brought here by Hemis to decorate his home.  Upon closer examination you see the dragons skeleton as covered in hundreds of lesser beastsskeletons.  Weapons hang across the walls.  A blood redcarpet covers the floor exact around the edges where a black marble floor is revealed.  Thick red curtains covermost of the wall and in the middle of the dragon skeleton's mouth lies a throne, in it sits a decorated corpse, it is Themis, patron god of Hemis.  The spirit of righteous justice.  Before the throne is a cushion with knee imprintsleft still in their surface where Hemis has kneeled timesuncounted.","This is Hemis's bedroom.  the obsidian walls meld softlyinto a black mound in the middle of the room where Hemissleeps.  It is hard to distinguise the bed from the curtainsthat fil the room.  Betond that the room is without decoration.","Upon entering this room a distinct sense of vertigo overcomesyou.  The floor is made of some crystal subtance that gives view to a deep chasm.  So deep in fact that your not even surethat you can see the bottom.  Was that movement you just saw down there?  It might have been.  Take a seat, the creaturesbelow might make for good entertainment.","This room is just what is says, a room for sex.  Pillow adornthe room and a statue of two naked bodies entwined stands in thecenter of the room.","A dark garden continually in shadow.  The darkness provides the plantlife with a light of it's own.  In the center of the garden is a blackpool that glows with it's dark energy.  Here Hemis finds solace from the pains of this world, safe in the arms of his garden.",0,0,0,0,})
